    m_Localized: AR Cells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23034101763
    m_Localized: Explore the interior of different types of cells in 3D interactively.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23034101764
    m_Localized: "\rPoint your phone's camera at the cell image to see it in 3D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5348955637448704
    m_Localized: 'To rotate it, touch and drag your finger across the screen.


      By
      touching the organelles you will see and hear information and interesting facts
      about them.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5349178308853760
    m_Localized: You can also zoom in on the camera for a closer look, or move your
      phone away for a wider view.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5350016410484736
    m_Localized: Get the cell images using the button below or by visiting the Interactive
      Science Space in person!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5350228122173440
    m_Localized: "\rDownload images"
